## Modern Keycloak 26 settings used

This client was scaffolded with non-legacy defaults:

- No implicit flow (`implicit_flow_enabled = false`)
- No direct access grants (`direct_access_grants_enabled = false`) — even for confidential clients
{%- if client_type == "public" %}
- PKCE enforced with `S256` (`pkce_code_challenge_method = "S256"`)
{%- endif %}
- No `client_secret` value committed to git — Keycloak generates it; DevOps delivers it out-of-band

If your application requires any of those legacy options, raise it with the SSO platform team before changing the .tf — do not flip the flag in the MR without an approved exception.
